  "summary": "",
  "preview": "",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"xiangqingchakan\"> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">社会经济的发展离不开金融的支持，私募股权投资作为一种金融投资工具</font><font face=\"宋体\">,已经成为资本市场不可或缺的一部分，尤其是私募股权投资近年来逐渐成为实体企业最为重要的融资渠道。不论是作为企业的经营管理者还是国家政府管理部门或政策制定者，都需要对私募基金投资有着基本的熟悉和了解。而在职业发展中，私募股权投资也因其高智力、高能力的要求以及良好的工作回报等而成为近年来毕业生就业的首选行业之一。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">为了提升我校研究生私募基金综合能力，为研究生就业提供多元知识技能基础，</font><a name=\"_Hlk515955201\"><font face=\"宋体\">清华大学全球私募股权研究院</font></a><font face=\"宋体\">依托经管学院，与清华大学研究生院联合开设</font></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">私募基金综合能力提升项目。</font></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">1.报名对象</font></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">面向本校全日制在读研究生。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">2.培养目标</font></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">通过私募基金基本理论、相关金融知识、法律知识、实践等课程的学习，旨在培养具有金融知识、产业发展的洞察力和预判能力、国际视野、资源整合等综合素质和能力，对私募基金有多角度全方位了解的复合型人才。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">3.项目特色</font></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">本项目重点在于学以致用，利用线上线下混合式互动的教学方法，提高学习效率和生源覆盖面。基础课程以培养学生的私募基金思维和技能作为基本目标，培养私募基金分析、管理和创新应用能力。实践环节学生将通过参与私募股权研究院举办的实践活动，提升私募基金实际应用能力。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">4.课程设置</font></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">模块一：基础课程（计学分，</font><font face=\"宋体\">6学分）</font></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">1）股权和创业投资基金概论（80516872，刘健钧</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">[</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">原中国证监会</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">]</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">，</font><font face=\"宋体\">32学时，2学分）</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">2</font><a name=\"_Hlk515362673\"><font face=\"宋体\">）</font></a><font face=\"宋体\">财务报表阅读与分析（</font><font face=\"宋体\">80517142，陈武朝，32学时，2学分）</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">3</font><a name=\"_Hlk515362678\"><font face=\"宋体\">）</font></a><font face=\"宋体\">公司金融（</font><font face=\"宋体\">60510142，朱玉杰，32学时，2学分）</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">4</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">私募股权基金的法律问题（</font><font face=\"宋体\">80516882，吕春燕，32学时，2学分）</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">5</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">创新投资（</font><font face=\"宋体\">60510462，肖星、周逵，32学时，2学分）</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">模块二：实践活动（二选一）</font></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">1)学习交流（活动计次卡，&ge;8次）</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">学生需参加由全球私募股权研究院组织的论坛、沙龙、企业走访等活动，从公司的战略布局、创新管理、商业模式、产品介绍、运营管理和人才培养体系等角度进行学习。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">考核方法：确认录取后，学生需参加不少于</font><font face=\"宋体\">8次的活动，并在每次活动结束后一周之内向项目办公室邮箱(</font></span></span><a href target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">wangxue@sem.tsinghua.edu.cn</font></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">)提交不少于1000字的学习心得。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">2）投资实践</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">学生需参加清华大学全球私募股权研究院研究部或实践单位举办的投资实践专题培训并完成相应的专题报告。专题培训包括：行业研究报告、如何寻找目标公司、如何撰写尽职调查报告、投资交易达成过程等。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">考核方法：学生参加实践单位的实践专题培训后，需和</font><a name=\"_Hlk516227798\"><font face=\"宋体\">实践单位</font></a><font face=\"宋体\">共同完成</font><font face=\"宋体\">“清华大学私募基金综合能力提升项目实践考核表”的填写。 </font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:24.0000pt; text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><a name=\"_Hlk502316574\"></a><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">5</font></span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">.</font></span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">报名及录取方式</font><a name=\"_Hlk516228298\"></a></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">1</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">报名：下载附件报名表格，将填好的报名表发送到项目办公室邮箱</font><font face=\"宋体\">(wangxue@sem.tsinghua.edu.cn)。电子邮件主题请命名为“清华大学私募基金综合能力提升项目-本人姓名”。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">2</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">录取：经项目审核确认录取后，项目办公室将以邮件方式通知正式成为项目成员。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">3</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">选课：请按照清华大学学生选课时间和要求选修项目模块一中的课程。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">报名时间：</font> <font face=\"宋体\">截止到</font><font face=\"宋体\">2026年8月30日，录取邮件不晚于9月1日通知。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">6.获得证书要求及证书申请</font></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">1</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">证书要求：学生需要在毕业前在第一模块</font><font face=\"宋体\">“基础课程”中获得6学分且完成第二模块“实践活动”中规定的要求，方可获得研究生院和全球私募股权研究院联合颁发的私募基金综合能力提升项目证书。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">2</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">证书申请：达到获得证书要求的同学，请在每学期开学第四周后以邮件方式提交成绩单扫描件及相关材料申请办理，经项目办公室核实批准后颁发证书。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">如有问题</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">，</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">请联系清华大学全球私募股权研究院项目办公室</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">联系人：</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">王雪</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">电话</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">：</font> <font face=\"宋体\">13681303558</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">邮箱：</font></span></span><a href target=\"_blank\"><u><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"宋体\">wangxue@sem.tsinghua.edu.cn，</font></span></span></span></span></u></a></span></span></span></span></sp